ble with C.\n\n## Verification (my own commands, not a sub-agent report)\nBuilt the C `.so` two ways (with and without `NDEBUG`), wrote a 380-line differential driver exercising every export, and diffed stdout:\n- **3859 lines byte-identical** (`cmp` clean, identical md5), stderr identical and empty, both exit 0.\n- The driver dumps *internal* state through C-computed struct offsets: every bucket's `hash`/`index`, `slot_count`, `used_count`, thresholds, evolving `seed`, arena `remaining`/`block`/`mode` — all match, which also proves struct sizes/offsets agree.\n- Also compared `malloc_usable_size` of every allocation and `storage_off` (aligned bucket-array offset) — identical, proving the allocation arithmetic and 64-byte alignment math match.\n- Paths covered: table growth 8→16→32→64→128, tombstone rebuild (tomb 12→2 at same slot count), shrink 128→64→32→16→8, `SH_DEFAULT`/`SH_STRDUP`/`SH_ARENA` string maps, `mode` = -5/0/1/2/3, arena block-doubling and oversize-block paths, `hmput_default`, `hmget_key_ts` on NULL, delete-on-NULL.\n\n`c_src/` was never modified (read-only), and my scratch build dirs were removed."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":861,"cache_read_input_tokens":112003,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":861,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f8282fcb-984b-4b2d-ad9e-26bf42e5757d","uuid":"f42cc41c-4eac-4feb-bc33-cc67c96d089b","timestamp":"2026-08-27T17:56:40.491Z"}
